WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.815
EXPLAIN shows PostgreSQL's planned execution
strategy This

00:00:05.829 --> 00:00:11.852
is useful for learning how the database intends to
access and combine rows In

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:17.756
this tiny browser dataset use the plan only to learn
structure Real

00:00:17.782 --> 00:00:23.335
performance tuning requires representative data
volume indexes statistics and workload

00:00:25.079 --> 00:00:28.868
Do not make production performance claims from a
small teaching example
